# --- Theme source (large personal Typora theme zip + extracted fonts) ---
# Contains proprietary Anthropic TTFs + multi-MB Noto Serif SC source —
# never commit. The bundled woff2 in src/assets/fonts/ are derived from
# these (Noto subset) or fetched from @fontsource (Latin) and ARE tracked.
theme/*.zip
theme/_extracted/
theme/主题V14.0/

# --- Personal build notes (instructs embedding proprietary fonts; keep local,
# do not publish to the public repo) ---
docs/personal-build-anthropic-fonts.md
src/assets/fonts/anthropic-*.woff2
src/assets/fonts/zhanku-*.woff2
src/assets/fonts/unifraktur-*.woff2
